# Build output — never committed (architecture.md §8: "Binary artefacts never in the working
# tree"). Release STL/3MF/STEP are built by CI on every push to main and attached to a GitHub
# Release instead (.github/workflows/release.yml, scripts/package_release.py).
exports/
dist/

# Local Python tooling venv (scripts/build.py). See README.md "Setup".
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OpenSCAD intermediate CSG evaluation output (scripts/build.py `smoke`).
*.csg

# Rendered/measured artefacts, wherever they land (belt-and-braces alongside exports/).
*.stl
*.3mf
*.step
*.summary.json
*.manifest.json

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local Claude Code settings (machine-specific permissions), never shared.
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Negations: third-party reference assets in knowledge/ are tracked even though their
# extensions match the binary-artefact globs above (architecture.md: knowledge/ is sourced,
# stable domain research, not build output). ---
!knowledge/**/assets/**
